  "content": "\n\n<h1>蓬鬆圓潤花簇</h1>\n<p>《蓬鬆圓潤花簇》是一款簡約優雅的資源包，讓孢子花變得更美觀。此資源包將紋理改為更圓潤的樣式，並更新模型以加入更多花瓣，呈現更飽滿、蓬鬆的外觀。它非常適合之前不喜歡原版花朵的玩家，同時不會偏離 Minecraft 的原始美學太多。</p>\n<h3>圖片</h3>\n<p>請至 Modrinth 頁面查看更多圖片。</p>\n<h6><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbushy-round-blossoms%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bushy-round-blossoms/gallery</a></h6>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bushy-round-blossoms/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbushy-round-blossoms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=1AD166\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uttj34u4PJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Server-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=5865f2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
